---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Sagging Gutters Woodbridge, VA | Re-Hang & Repair" description="Sagging or pulling-away gutters in Woodbridge? We re-hang, replace hangers, and restore proper pitch. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Sagging Gutters</div>
      <h1>Sagging Gutters in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Pulling away from the fascia usually means failed hangers or overloaded sections. Quick re-hanging prevents bigger repairs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Hidden hangers and spikes eventually loosen. We install proper fasteners at correct intervals, restore pitch, and secure the system so it stays in place through storms.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
